      "_id": "8d55a68bf4314fc7",
      "name": "Obtenebration — 1 Basic — Shadow Play",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/magic/unholy/silhouette-evil-horned-summon.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>By spending a Blood Trait, you animate nearby shadows for a scene or hour, granting yourself a bonus Trait in stealth or ranged combat for concealment, a bonus Trait in intimidation, or afflicting a victim with Clumsy and slow asphyxiating damage.</p>",
